	(text "Its own symbol so the head's E+/E- stay nets of their\nown (CELL_*), out of the toolhead PCB's GND:\nthey meet the rails only here, at J952. Off any\nboard: J952 is where it lands."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "293c53b2-3a5e-4fdf-9655-2cc1007fd6d7")
	)
	(text "CAT6 UTP, 0.6-1 m"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "934cbdea-6c9a-41d8-9e9d-373f87507f99")
	)
	(text "Stranded (patch) cable, through\nthe cable chain. MX1.25 here.\n\nPad: wire = signal\n1: white-orange = E+ (3V3)\n8: orange = E- (GND)\n3: white-blue = S+ (SIG_P)\n4: blue = S- (SIG_N)\n5: white-green = TOOL_ID\n6: green = GND (the ID's return)\n2, 7: white-brown, brown = spare\n\nAll DC.\nHead end: the axis breakout\n(sheet Toolhead)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0530eb42-d4bf-4a7f-9a8c-c1ec547ee02f")
	)
	(text "TOOL 5 V + USB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4d73a48b-c285-43cc-9882-3b6634fc9744")
	)
	(text "A USB-C cable from the hub\nboard (U1007) to the axis\nbreakout: it passes this\nboard by."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a6eedeb7-7bf7-46a0-a4cd-55293c6ba94d")
	)
